@startuml
title Foundation - L2 ExecutionContext Propagation
actor Caller
participant ExecutionContext
participant StandardContextCodec
participant ContextCarrier
participant "Downstream Component" as D
Caller -> ExecutionContext : build context
Caller -> StandardContextCodec : write(context, carrier)
StandardContextCodec -> ContextCarrier : set standard keys
Caller -> D : pass carrier
D -> StandardContextCodec : read(carrier)
StandardContextCodec -> ContextCarrier : get standard keys
StandardContextCodec --> D : ExecutionContext
@enduml
